# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-5ac539b764e5592850f794cb338c4b5a1c72faf2 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The handbook's parking rule specifies that certain parking spaces are reserved and that there is a time limit for parking. Specifically, bays 12 through 30 are reserved, and the time limit for parking in these spaces is two hours [[cite:obs-5ac539b764e5592850f794cb338c4b5a1c72faf2 "## Parking\n\nVehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

